        "text": "New @MenloVentures data: Chinese open-weight models now capture 89% of US enterprise open-source AI spend (@Kimi_Moonshot 61%, @deepseek_ai 15%, @THUDM 11%, @Alibaba_Qwen 3%) while Llama fell to 7%! Full breakdown via @GitGem #OpenSource #AI https://t.co/ELhf2eR4or",
