        "text": "Another strong contender joins the open-weight lineup: LongCat-2.5. 🐱\n\nIts weights are now available under the MIT license:\nhttps://t.co/AgF4fFPKuV\n\nThe model from @Meituan_LongCat brings 1.6T total parameters, ~48B activated per token, native multimodality, and a focus on https://t.co/DPZXBCYZP6",
