        "text": "Alibaba just opened the door on Qwen4, and the first thing I noticed wasn't a benchmark. It was the expiration date.\n\nQwen4-Max Preview went live on November 11 at 10:00 Beijing time, and Alibaba's own docs say the preview runs until 24:00 on November 25. After that, this model",
