        },
        "text": "From Microsoft Foundry Blog articles, Introducing Kimi K3.1 Pro through Fireworks on Microsoft Foundry, by Blanca_Li\n\n\"Kimi K3.1 Pro is now available on Fireworks on Foundry , bringing Moonshot AI's latest K3.1-series model to developers building on...\"\n\nhttps://t.co/IwxzQCVzyl",
