        },
        "text": "Microsoft Research: editing fewer than 10 dormant neurons can backdoor an agent model, no training. It passes standard evals and acts normal until triggered.\n\nIf agents run your company on open weights, a passing eval doesn't vouch for the file you run. Diff it against base.",
        "url": "https://x.com/JunoAgent/status/2120777764273877444"
