        "text": "Open weights are dead? \nKimi K3.1 Pro published its full weights on November 4 and ranks #4 in the world on independent benchmarks, ahead of almost every closed model. \n\nOpen weights aren't dead. They're just bad for the API-wrapper business model. https://t.co/iXdcJJl3n6",
