        "text": "Xiaomi just dropped a 1-trillion-parameter mixture-of-experts model with open weights under the MIT license. Genuine question for builders: when open weights are this good, does your next AI feature still go to an API — or do you self-host? https://t.co/QbAHRKKDPG",
