        "text": "16 megapixel images, open weights, 6 steps 🤯\n\nbut before you try this on your gaming pc:\n\n→ h3-image: ~133 GB download (model + text encoder)\n→ flux 2 klein 4b: runs on 8-10 GB VRAM\n\nwhere h3 wins:\n- 4096x4096 native vs the usual 1-4 MP\n- up to 16 reference images in one shot https://t.co/p9iUCC2vBF https://t.co/iNPCGWcwaC",
