        },
        "text": "Tether released QVAC BotPsy, an open-weight 800M-parameter AI agent small enough to run on a phone.\n\nIn Tether's tests, it roughly doubled the tool-use scores of its 0.8B base and outperformed a model 2.5x its size on four agent benchmarks. #AIAgents\n\nhttps://t.co/d91qkup8Uc",
