        "text": "T3 Code just passed 1,000 GitHub contributors today, and Theo says open weight models are under 0.5% of its traffic. Here's what you need to know.\n\nTheo (https://t.co/36o5oRW2W7) posted that T3 Code has broken 1,000 contributors. The count is now reported at 1,042. T3 Code is an https://t.co/yd7angQa9B https://t.co/7RD2KBysVk",
