        "text": "Make no mistake. The Jensen Huang scandal isn't just a story about someone's private life.\n\nIt's a lever. And it's going to be used for one thing: taking control of AI.\n\nI'm not saying the facts are made up. Jensen admitted the affairs, and the investigation should run its https://t.co/Se2A4tma57",
