        "text": "Following its open-weights video model in August, MiniMax has released and open-sourced its new flagship image generator, H3 Image. The most striking benchmark is rendering speed at high resolution.\n\nIn hands-on testing, generating a native 4096×4096 4K image took just 10 to 20",
