        "text": "Open weight models are under 0.5% of T3 Code's traffic (per @theo).\n\nWe argue about open models all day. Actual usage inside a coding agent? A rounding error.\n\nWhen the work is real, devs pay for the best model, not the free one.\n\nDo you still run an open model in your loop?",
